      ],
      "block_preview_text": "Highlight that NRCS assists in demonstrating innovative practices, coordinating implementation efforts, and providing technical assistance. Note that animal operations need to manage activities and sources such as manure, silage leachate, milkhouse waste, chemicals, and animal mortalities. Explain that the main categories of conservation practices include manure management, land and pasture management, and mortality or dead animal management."
    },
    {
      "block_id": 2,
      "time_start": 251.55,
      "time_end": 265.71,
      "dominant_category": "motion",
      "category_distribution": {
        "motion": 1
