        },
        {
          "task_index": 1,
          "sub_index": 7
        }
      ],
      "block_preview_text": "Describe how systems to collect and store manure keep it contained and allow for application to fields where nutrients can be recycled. Highlight that farmers can use fences, stream crossings, or livestock watering systems to limit livestock access to surface water."
    },
